### C-037
- statement: (Prop 3.1, part d.) With monomial generators the same promise problem is
  classical `k`-SAT, NP-complete for `k ≥ 3`.
- status: SKETCH
- depends-on: C-034
- where-proved: report.md §3 (Prop 3.1)
- where-tested: none
- referee: round1 #48 confirms.
