  the `k`-body marginals of `I_N` satisfies `conj(u)(∂)(f h) = 0` for a generator `f` and
  all `h ∈ R_{N-m}`. Taking `h = ℓ^{N-m}` with `ℓ` a linear form, `u(ℓ) ≠ 0`, `ℓ ∤ f`, and
  coordinates with `ℓ = z_0`, the coefficient of `z_0^{N-m-k}` in
